OL,3,ASharing dangerous driving videos is
OL,4,A'truly reprehensible', PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has urged social media
OL,7,Fcompanies to remove posts celebrating
OL,8,Fdangerous driving, as Prime Minister
OL,9,FAndy Burnham branded sharing them
OL,10,F"truly reprehensible".
OL,12,FEarlier Defence Minister Luke Pollard
OL,13,Ftold BBC Breakfast that "social media
OL,14,Fcompanies could take the content down
OL,15,Feasily and adjust their algorithms to
OL,16,Fstop it being distributed".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
