OL,3,ATens of thousands urged to evacuate as
OL,4,Awildfire approaches Reno, Nevada
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It came super fast, within 20 minutes
OL,7,Fwe got the alarm to get out of there,"
OL,8,Fone local resident who saw the fire
OL,9,Fcoming down the hill says
OL,11,FOfficials say six people have been
OL,12,Finjured, including three emergency
OL,13,Fresponders, and around 15,000 acres (23
OL,14,Fsq miles) have been burned - satellite
OL,15,Fimagery shows the impact
OL,17,FWildfires are common in south-west US
OL,18,Fstates, including Nevada, but many of
OL,19,Fthese fires develop in rural and less
OL,20,Fpopulated areas
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
